  m_text: "Amr Elmahdy - Community Founder\r\n\r\nNorahn amr - Head of game design\r\nEsraa
    Adel - Head of game artist\r\nMenna Alla Mamduh - Vice head of game artist \r\nMohamed
    nasser - Leader of game development \r\nAbanoob Nabil - Leader of audio production
    \r\n\r\nJana Hamdy - Game designer , Audio producer \r\nMaya Ahmed - Game designer,
    Audio producer\r\nLama Mohammed - Game designer\r\n\r\nOmar Tantawy - Game developer\r\nKerollos
    Nabil - Game developer\r\nAmr Abdalla - Game developer\r\n\r\nEsraa Anas - Game
    artist\r\nBassam tello - Game artist\r\nMayar - Game artist\r\n\r\nCreated in
    96 hours for GMTK Game Jam 2026.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by Orpita Game Community \u2014
    an Egyptian volunteer game development community where passionate developers,
    artists, designers, and creators come together to learn, collaborate, and create
    games.\r\n\r\nThank you for playing The Last Lantern.\r\n"
